(Problem: The 7th term of an arithmetic sequence is 30 and its 11th term is 46.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.18 0.18 0.18 rg
50 485 Td
(Find the common difference, first term, and the sum of first 20 terms.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.18 0.18 0.18 rg
50 465 Td
(Solution Step 1: d = \(x_11 - x_7\) / \(11 - 7\) = \(46 - 30\) / 4 = 16 / 4 = 4.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.18 0.18 0.18 rg
50 445 Td
(Solution Step 2: x_1 = x_7 - 6d = 30 - 6\(4\) = 30 - 24 = 6. \(First term = 6\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
0.18 0.18 0.18 rg
50 425 Td
(Solution Step 3: S_20 = \(20 / 2\) * [2\(6\) + \(20 - 1\)\(4\)] = 10 * [12 + 76] = 10 * 88) Tj
ET
